Revision history for Perl module Paubox_Email_SDK / Paubox_Forms_SDK

Unreleased

    - Paubox_Email_SDK -> new() now accepts either the apiKey / apiUsername
      or the API_KEY / API_USERNAME key spellings in config.cfg. Only
      apiKey / apiUsername previously worked, while README.md, api.md and
      CLAUDE.md all documented API_KEY / API_USERNAME, so a config.cfg
      written per the docs made new() die with "apiKey is missing."
      Documentation updated to be self-consistent.

    - Removed the stale Paubox_Email_SDK-1.2.tar.gz build artifact that was
      checked into the repository and pointed at by README.md as an install
      path. README.md now documents building from source, and *.tar.gz is
      git-ignored.

    - Added lib/Paubox_Forms_SDK.pm to MANIFEST; `make dist` would otherwise
      have produced a release with no Forms module. Also added the t/ test
      files, cpanfile and api.md to MANIFEST.

1.3 2024-01-01

    - Added Paubox_Forms_SDK module with getForm and submitForm methods.

    - Updated ApiHelper to conditionally set Authorization header,
      enabling use with public (no-auth) Forms API endpoints.

1.2 2019-07-01
    
    - Added cc property

    - Added changes file
 
1.1 2019-06-05

    - Added force secure notification property.

    - Base64 encoded html content.
 
1.0 2019-04-06

    - Initial release.